  "finding": "The only notice-index candidate, bfc-2021-146:p36, was read from its page image (page 37). The EARL Domaine Philippe Girard receipt, dossier 2021-122, prints Chambolle-Musigny A139; DFI retired A0139 on 9 November 1995, so the 2021 reference is not joined to its descendant A0301. The OCR hint AN37 is printed under Savigny-les-Beaune. Both are recorded as rejected in the curation. Six other raw OCR reference-hint hits are in notices that never name Chambolle-Musigny; they are recorded but not assigned. No exact Musigny notice event is supported.",
